namespace Mhodume;

/// <summary>
/// What the game calls each level, as against what the file is called.
///
/// The save file keys times by level asset name — Gold_ConaptProject04 — and
/// the game's own menu shows conapt04. Some are not guessable at all:
/// Gold_fastlife02 is "admin", Gold_onlyup is "kreedz", Gold_test00 is
/// "mucuslife00". Showing the file name meant showing something no player
/// recognises.
///
/// Generated by tools/genmapnames.py from DA_MapList inside the game's pak,
/// which is where the menu reads it from. Baked in because the app cannot open
/// the pak at runtime: that needs Oodle and a copy of the game.
/// </summary>
public static class MapNames
{
